<body>
    {{> header}}
    <div class="terms-container">
        <h1 class="platillos-title">Platillos</h1>
        <h2>About</h2>

        <p>Platillos is a community-driven platform for discovering and reviewing individual dishes at restaurants. Instead of rating an entire restaurant, Platillos lets you focus on what really matters — the food itself.</p>

        <h3>Why Platillos?</h3>
        <p>We've all had this experience. There's a new restaurant in town, and you go to try it out. It's awesome, so you recommend it to a friend. They check it out, and the next time you see them, you ask them how it was, even though you already know the answer. But to your surprise, they say "Eh, it was fine." You're confused, but you follow up with the critical question:</p>
        <p>"Well, what did you get?"</p>
        <p>That's what Platillos is trying to solve! Platillos wants you to have the best food when you go out to eat, and it lets restaurants shine by putting their best foot forward. It shows you which restaurants are consistent and deliver great food day after day, and it tell you when a dish has improved and it's time to give it another shot.</p>

        <h3>How It Works</h3>
        <p>Search for a dish or restaurant, read reviews from other food lovers, and share your own experiences. Each review is tied to a specific dish, so you can find exactly what's worth ordering.</p>



        <h3>Get Started</h3>
        <p><a href="/register">Create an account</a> to start logging your favorite dishes, leaving reviews, and building your personal food journal.</p>

        <h3>Support Platillos</h3>
        <p>Platillos is built and run by just me, because I love food! If you enjoy using it, consider buying me a coffee to help keep the servers running!</p>
        <p style="text-align: center; margin: 1.5rem 0;">
            <a href="https://buymeacoffee.com/platillos" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-turquoise" style="display: inline-block; padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem; font-size: 1rem; text-decoration: none; color: #fff;">☕ Buy Me a Coffee</a>
        </p>

